    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d254-a2">

                <pb facs="0776" n="741" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v39/pg741"/>

                <head>Tab D<anchor n="4" xml:id="d254-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">MBFR</hi>
                </p>
                <p>There has been no movement in Vienna since the talks resumed September 16.
                    Meanwhile we are working with our Allies in NATO on the introduction of air
                    manpower into the talks (in accordance with the NSDM).<anchor n="5"
                        xml:id="d254-f2"/> In view of your recent go-around with Gromyko on
                        MBFR,<anchor n="6" xml:id="d254-f3"/> there seems little more that can
                    usefully be said to Dobrynin before you leave for Moscow.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
